WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.671
Begin with the largest dark shape.

00:00:02.671 --> 00:00:06.598
Let the surrounding white space describe its edge.

00:00:06.598 --> 00:00:11.783
Add only the lines that explain a change of direction or material.

00:00:11.783 --> 00:00:17.911
In the second frame, notice how a repeated diagonal suggests a folded surface.

00:00:17.911 --> 00:00:22.232
In the last, leave an open area where the eye can rest.

00:00:22.232 --> 00:00:27.260
The exercise uses original drawings inspired by paper and water.

